    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were once a generous claw machine arcade owner famous for your player-friendly machines. Now, you become bankrupt due to your kindness... Left with only a single claw machine in your uncle's garage, you chose to transform into a cunning entrepreneur! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/714df01cc0018cb2e810d7b26da392da.avif?t=1753676632\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Arcade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and customize your arcade with unique claw machines, furniture, posters, and decorations. Mix and match machines and furniture to find out the perfect combo to boost your arcade\u2019s popularity and comfort to attract more players!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/f214abb60d49fbcbd15ff2ffe5968ff0.poster.avif?t=1753676632\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/f214abb60d49fbcbd15ff2ffe5968ff0.webm?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/f214abb60d49fbcbd15ff2ffe5968ff0.mp4?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Action Cards</strong><br>Use action cards inspired by real-life tricks to outwit your players! Weaken or tilting claws, activating magnets\u2026 every card gives you an edge. But beware that some cards will damage your machines or hurt your arcade\u2019s rating. Use them wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/3379bc252460f5493c503309c7747784.poster.avif?t=1753676632\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/3379bc252460f5493c503309c7747784.webm?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/3379bc252460f5493c503309c7747784.mp4?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Challenge Arcades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge neighboring arcades to increase arcade ranks and unlock new features. Outsmart opponent owners by stopping them from winning your prizes, or send your players to raid their arcades instead. Beat the arcades to get rewards and expand your arcade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/acc9c99450c4ac11b272f5c404b71525.poster.avif?t=1753676632\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/acc9c99450c4ac11b272f5c404b71525.webm?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/acc9c99450c4ac11b272f5c404b71525.mp4?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key</strong>\u00a0<strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Life Inspired Mechanics</strong>: Machines, claws, traps, prizes, and action cards are referencing real claw machine arcades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Tough Machines</strong>: Balance difficulty and rewards carefully\u2014too hard, and players will avoid your machines; too easy, and you\u2019ll lose profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trending Prizes</strong>: Stock your machines with trending prize themes and types to keep your arcade with the most popularity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-On Service</strong>: Help players by relocating prizes, packaging plushies, exchanging coins, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Missions and Random Events</strong>: Complete tasks to unlock new furniture, prize sets, and action cards to grow your arcade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Arcade</strong>: Add new rooms with special functions, build additional floors, and customize your arcade.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were once a generous claw machine arcade owner famous for your player-friendly machines. Now, you become bankrupt due to your kindness... Left with only a single claw machine in your uncle's garage, you chose to transform into a cunning entrepreneur! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/714df01cc0018cb2e810d7b26da392da.avif?t=1753676632\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Arcade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and customize your arcade with unique claw machines, furniture, posters, and decorations. Mix and match machines and furniture to find out the perfect combo to boost your arcade\u2019s popularity and comfort to attract more players!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/f214abb60d49fbcbd15ff2ffe5968ff0.poster.avif?t=1753676632\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/f214abb60d49fbcbd15ff2ffe5968ff0.webm?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/f214abb60d49fbcbd15ff2ffe5968ff0.mp4?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Action Cards</strong><br>Use action cards inspired by real-life tricks to outwit your players! Weaken or tilting claws, activating magnets\u2026 every card gives you an edge. But beware that some cards will damage your machines or hurt your arcade\u2019s rating. Use them wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/3379bc252460f5493c503309c7747784.poster.avif?t=1753676632\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/3379bc252460f5493c503309c7747784.webm?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/3379bc252460f5493c503309c7747784.mp4?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Challenge Arcades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge neighboring arcades to increase arcade ranks and unlock new features. Outsmart opponent owners by stopping them from winning your prizes, or send your players to raid their arcades instead. Beat the arcades to get rewards and expand your arcade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/acc9c99450c4ac11b272f5c404b71525.poster.avif?t=1753676632\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/acc9c99450c4ac11b272f5c404b71525.webm?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424940/extras/acc9c99450c4ac11b272f5c404b71525.mp4?t=1753676632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key</strong>\u00a0<strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Life Inspired Mechanics</strong>: Machines, claws, traps, prizes, and action cards are referencing real claw machine arcades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Tough Machines</strong>: Balance difficulty and rewards carefully\u2014too hard, and players will avoid your machines; too easy, and you\u2019ll lose profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trending Prizes</strong>: Stock your machines with trending prize themes and types to keep your arcade with the most popularity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-On Service</strong>: Help players by relocating prizes, packaging plushies, exchanging coins, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Missions and Random Events</strong>: Complete tasks to unlock new furniture, prize sets, and action cards to grow your arcade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Arcade</strong>: Add new rooms with special functions, build additional floors, and customize your arcade.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Manage a claw machine arcade in this cozy-but-evil management sim. Build rigged claw machines and play sneaky action cards to stop players from getting a prize! Build your arcade, design machines, compete against opponent arcades and face off against boss players to grow your arcade around the city!",
